{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DGxPgj4SvaT2v7r9Ds1NM5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"multi_judge_data_collection\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"收集 8 judge × 20+ target models 在 MT-Bench 和 Arena-Hard 上的多评委评分数据。 Position swap 后总评估量约 8×20×2×(80+500)=185,600 次。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"num_judges\": 8,\n7\t      \"num_target_models\": 22,\n8\t      \"num_benchmarks\": 2,\n9\t      \"total_evaluations\": \"~186000\",\n10\t      \"api_cost_usd\": 870,\n11\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 118,\n12\t      \"missing_rate_pct\": 1.2,\n13\t      \"inter_judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa\": 0.38,\n14\t      \"position_bias_swap_disagreement_pct\": 14.5\n15\t    },\n16\t    \"tables\": [\n17\t      {\n18\t        \"name\": \"Table A1: Data Collection Summary\",\n19\t        \"columns\": [\n20\t          \"benchmark\",\n21\t          \"num_items\",\n22\t          \"num_judges\",\n23\t          \"num_models\",\n24\t          \"total_evals\",\n25\t          \"missing_pct\"\n26\t        ],\n27\t        \"rows\": [\n28\t          [\n29\t            \"MT-Bench\",\n30\t            80,\n31\t            8,\n32\t            22,\n33\t            28160,\n34\t            0.8\n35\t          ],\n36\t          [\n37\t            \"Arena-Hard\",\n38\t            500,\n39\t            8,\n40\t            22,\n41\t            176000,\n42\t            1.3\n43\t          ]\n44\t        ]\n45\t      }\n46\t    ],\n47\t    \"figures\": [],\n48\t    \"analysis\": \"数据收集是中性步骤。关键观察：judge severity 的变异足够大（κ~0.38）， 说明 MFRM 对 d_j 的建模有实质价值——这为 pivot (2) \\\"Judge Bias as Main Story\\\" 保留了空间。数据完整性和规模满足后续所有实验需求。\\n\\n\\n数据收集本身不受 contamination 量级影响，预期正常完成。 inter-judge agreement 中等偏低（κ~0.38）反映 LLM judge 间固有差异—— 这本身支持 MFRM 建模 judge severity 的必要性。Position swap disagreement ~14.5% 是 MT-Bench/Arena-Hard 上的典型值。数据质量足以支撑下游分析， 但不会改变\\\"真实污染弱\\\"的底层事实。\\n\"\n49\t  },\n50\t  {\n51\t    \"name\": \"constat_exposure_estimation\",\n52\t    \"description\": \"通过 ConStat 方法估计每个 benchmark item 的 exposure 指标 e_i： 生成参考变体（rephrased），计算 delta scores，结合 temporal signals。\\n\",\n53\t    \"results\": {\n54\t      \"num_items_mtbench\": 80,\n55\t      \"num_items_arenahard\": 500,\n56\t      \"num_reference_variants_per_item\": 3,\n57\t      \"constat_delta_mean\": 0.08,\n58\t      \"constat_delta_std\": 0.12,\n59\t      \"constat_delta_median\": 0.04,\n60\t      \"items_with_significant_delta_pct\": 12.0,\n61\t      \"rank_correlation_constat_vs_temporal\": 0.31,\n62\t      \"human_equivalence_check_pass_rate_pct\": 89,\n63\t      \"e_i_distribution_skewness\": 2.1,\n64\t      \"effective_signal_items_pct\": 15\n65\t    },\n66\t    \"tables\": [\n67\t      {\n68\t        \"name\": \"Table S2: Exposure Indicator Statistics\",\n69\t        \"columns\": [\n70\t          \"indicator\",\n71\t          \"mean\",\n72\t          \"std\",\n73\t          \"median\",\n74\t          \"pct_significant\"\n75\t        ],\n76\t        \"rows\": [\n77\t          [\n78\t            \"ConStat_delta\",\n79\t            0.08,\n80\t            0.12,\n81\t            0.04,\n82\t            12.0\n83\t          ],\n84\t          [\n85\t            \"temporal_signal\",\n86\t            0.05,\n87\t            0.09,\n88\t            0.02,\n89\t            8.5\n90\t          ],\n91\t          [\n92\t            \"composite_e_i\",\n93\t            0.07,\n94\t            0.1,\n95\t            0.03,\n96\t            11.0\n97\t          ]\n98\t        ]\n99\t      }\n100\t    ],\n101\t    \"figures\": [],\n102\t    \"analysis\": \"exposure 信号的整体微弱是 worst 档的核心特征之一。这并非方法论失败—— ConStat 在合成数据上 r²=0.94 是已验证的——而是反映真实数据中主流 LLM 的 benchmark 污染确实已被缓解（训练数据清洗、instruction tuning 策略改进）。 对 pivot (1) 有利：e_i 接近零本身就是 G-MFRM 框架产出的有价值诊断结论。 但对原始 framing 致命：没有足够的 exposure 变异来驱动 c_n 估计。\\n\\n\\nworst 档下，真实污染量级弱（c̄ < 0.4），大多数 item 的 ConStat delta 接近零（均值 0.08），因为模型在原题和变体上的表现差异主要来自噪声而非记忆。 仅约 12% 的 item 有统计显著的 delta——这些可能对应少数确实被泄露的题目， 但整体 exposure 信号微弱。e_i 分布高度右偏（skewness=2.1）：绝大多数 item 的 e_i 接近零，少数 item 有中等信号。ConStat 与 temporal signal 的 rank correlation 仅 0.31，说明两个 indicator 捕捉的是不同维度的噪声 而非一致的污染信号。参考变体的人工等价性检查通过率 89% 是可接受的， 说明变体质量不是瓶颈——问题在于污染本身就弱。\\n\"\n103\t  },\n104\t  {\n105\t    \"name\": \"gmfrm_real_data_fit\",\n106\t    \"description\": \"在 exp-001/002 的真实数据上拟合 G-MFRM 三阶段流程。 Stage 1: MFRM 估计 θ,b,d。Stage 2: 使用 exp-002 的 e_i。 Stage 3: Joint gated model。与 Chatbot Arena 人类投票比较。\\n\",\n107\t    \"results\": {\n108\t      \"stage1_convergence_max_rhat\": 1.01,\n109\t      \"stage1_convergence_min_ess\": 820,\n110\t      \"stage1_kendall_tau_arena\": 0.843,\n111\t      \"stage1_d_j_range\": [\n112\t        -0.62,\n113\t        0.71\n114\t      ],\n115\t      \"stage1_d_j_std\": 0.35,\n116\t      \"stage3_convergence_max_rhat\": 1.06,\n117\t      \"stage3_convergence_min_ess\": 112,\n118\t      \"stage3_kendall_tau_arena\": 0.851,\n119\t      \"c_n_posterior_mean\": 0.14,\n120\t      \"c_n_posterior_std\": 0.11,\n121\t      \"c_n_95ci_covers_zero_pct\": 78,\n122\t      \"c_n_prior_posterior_kl_divergence\": 0.08,\n123\t      \"delta_tau_stage3_vs_stage1\": 0.008,\n124\t      \"wilcoxon_p_stage3_vs_stage1\": 0.34,\n125\t      \"runtime_seconds\": 5200\n126\t    },\n127\t    \"tables\": [\n128\t      {\n129\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: G-MFRM Real Data Fit Summary\",\n130\t        \"columns\": [\n131\t          \"stage\",\n132\t          \"model\",\n133\t          \"max_rhat\",\n134\t          \"min_ess\",\n135\t          \"tau_arena\",\n136\t          \"num_params\"\n137\t        ],\n138\t        \"rows\": [\n139\t          [\n140\t            \"Stage 1\",\n141\t            \"MFRM\",\n142\t            1.01,\n143\t            820,\n144\t            0.843,\n145\t            110\n146\t          ],\n147\t          [\n148\t            \"Stage 3\",\n149\t            \"G-MFRM Joint\",\n150\t            1.06,\n151\t            112,\n152\t            0.851,\n153\t            132\n154\t          ]\n155\t        ]\n156\t      },\n157\t      {\n158\t        \"name\": \"Table S3: c_n Posterior Summary (Top 10 Models by c_n)\",\n159\t        \"columns\": [\n160\t          \"model\",\n161\t          \"c_n_mean\",\n162\t          \"c_n_std\",\n163\t          \"95%CI_lower\",\n164\t          \"95%CI_upper\",\n165\t          \"covers_zero\"\n166\t        ],\n167\t        \"rows\": [\n168\t          [\n169\t            \"model_A\",\n170\t            0.38,\n171\t            0.15,\n172\t            0.09,\n173\t            0.67,\n174\t            false\n175\t          ],\n176\t          [\n177\t            \"model_B\",\n178\t            0.31,\n179\t            0.17,\n180\t            -0.02,\n181\t            0.64,\n182\t            true\n183\t          ],\n184\t          [\n185\t            \"model_C\",\n186\t            0.27,\n187\t            0.14,\n188\t            0.0,\n189\t            0.54,\n190\t            true\n191\t          ],\n192\t          [\n193\t            \"...(remaining 19 models)\",\n194\t            \"0.02–0.22\",\n195\t            \"0.10–0.18\",\n196\t            \"—\",\n197\t            \"—\",\n198\t            \"mostly true\"\n199\t          ]\n200\t        ]\n201\t      }\n202\t    ],\n203\t    \"figures\": [],\n204\t    \"analysis\": \"这是 worst 档的决定性实验。c_n 先验主导后验是最核心的 red flag—— 说明真实数据中缺乏足够的污染信号来支撑 contamination 参数的估计。 G-MFRM 有效退化为 MFRM。但注意 Stage 1 MFRM 本身表现良好（τ=0.843）， d_j 估计有实质意义——这为 pivot (2) \\\"Judge Bias as Main Story\\\" 提供支撑。 收敛不佳但未完全失败（R̂=1.06 在边界内），可解释为\\\"模型参数化过度\\\" 而非\\\"模型错误\\\"。\\n\\n\\nStage 1 MFRM 收敛良好（R̂=1.01, ESS=820），因为 MFRM 是成熟模型， judge severity d_j 有充足数据支撑。Stage 1 的 τ=0.843 反映 MFRM 对 judge bias 的有效校正。Stage 3 joint model 收敛变差（R̂=1.06, ESS=112）——c_n 参数数据信息量不足时，MCMC 在先验附近 random walk， 链间混合慢。c_n 后验均值仅 0.14，78% 的模型 c_n 的 95% 可信区间 覆盖零，说明先验主导后验——数据中没有足够信号将 c_n 从先验拉开。 prior-posterior KL 仅 0.08 进一步确认这一点。Stage 3 的 τ=0.851 比 Stage 1 仅高 0.008，Wilcoxon p=0.34 远不显著。本质上 joint model 退化为一个带噪声 c_n 项的 MFRM——gating 机制因 e_i 信号弱而几乎 不激活，c_n 被先验钉在零附近，θ 估计基本等于 Stage 1 的 MFRM 估计。\\n\"\n205\t  },\n206\t  {\n207\t    \"name\": \"baseline_comparison\",\n208\t    \"description\": \"在相同数据上比较 G-MFRM 与 7 个 baselines。\\n\",\n209\t    \"results\": {\n210\t      \"raw_average_tau\": 0.812,\n211\t      \"raw_average_spearman\": 0.847,\n212\t      \"mfrm_only_tau\": 0.843,\n213\t      \"mfrm_only_spearman\": 0.871,\n214\t      \"sequential_tau\": 0.845,\n215\t      \"sequential_spearman\": 0.873,\n216\t      \"cyclicjudge_tau\": 0.838,\n217\t      \"cyclicjudge_spearman\": 0.866,\n218\t      \"dcr_factor_tau\": 0.819,\n219\t      \"dcr_factor_spearman\": 0.853,\n220\t      \"uda_tau\": 0.841,\n221\t      \"uda_spearman\": 0.869,\n222\t      \"pref_leakage_tau\": 0.824,\n223\t      \"pref_leakage_spearman\": 0.858,\n224\t      \"gmfrm_joint_tau\": 0.851,\n225\t      \"gmfrm_joint_spearman\": 0.878,\n226\t      \"delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline\": 0.006,\n227\t      \"delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_sequential\": 0.006,\n228\t      \"wilcoxon_p_gmfrm_vs_sequential\": 0.28,\n229\t      \"wilcoxon_p_gmfrm_vs_mfrm\": 0.31,\n230\t      \"bootstrap_95ci_delta_tau\": [\n231\t        -0.008,\n232\t        0.021\n233\t      ]\n234\t    },\n235\t    \"tables\": [\n236\t      {\n237\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Main Results — Kendall-τ with Chatbot Arena\",\n238\t        \"columns\": [\n239\t          \"method\",\n240\t          \"MT-Bench τ\",\n241\t          \"Arena-Hard τ\",\n242\t          \"Average τ\",\n243\t          \"Spearman ρ\",\n244\t          \"p vs G-MFRM\"\n245\t        ],\n246\t        \"rows\": [\n247\t          [\n248\t            \"Raw Average\",\n249\t            0.801,\n250\t            0.823,\n251\t            0.812,\n252\t            0.847,\n253\t            0.003\n254\t          ],\n255\t          [\n256\t            \"MFRM-only\",\n257\t            0.836,\n258\t            0.85,\n259\t            0.843,\n260\t            0.871,\n261\t            0.31\n262\t          ],\n263\t          [\n264\t            \"Sequential (bias→contam)\",\n265\t            0.839,\n266\t            0.851,\n267\t            0.845,\n268\t            0.873,\n269\t            0.28\n270\t          ],\n271\t          [\n272\t            \"CyclicJudge\",\n273\t            0.831,\n274\t            0.845,\n275\t            0.838,\n276\t            0.866,\n277\t            0.14\n278\t          ],\n279\t          [\n280\t            \"DCR Factor\",\n281\t            0.81,\n282\t            0.828,\n283\t            0.819,\n284\t            0.853,\n285\t            0.008\n286\t          ],\n287\t          [\n288\t            \"UDA\",\n289\t            0.834,\n290\t            0.848,\n291\t            0.841,\n292\t            0.869,\n293\t            0.22\n294\t          ],\n295\t          [\n296\t            \"Pref Leakage\",\n297\t            0.815,\n298\t            0.833,\n299\t            0.824,\n300\t            0.858,\n301\t            0.012\n302\t          ],\n303\t          [\n304\t            \"**G-MFRM (ours)**\",\n305\t            \"**0.845**\",\n306\t            \"**0.857**\",\n307\t            \"**0.851**\",\n308\t            \"**0.878**\",\n309\t            \"—\"\n310\t          ]\n311\t        ]\n312\t      }\n313\t    ],\n314\t    \"figures\": [],\n315\t    \"analysis\": \"主结果表无法支撑 Empirical Claim (claim 3) 的原始表述（\\\"higher agreement than all baselines\\\"）。G-MFRM 名义最优但不显著优于 MFRM-only 和 sequential。 但 MFRM 部分（judge bias 校正）相对 raw average 的改进是显著的（+0.031 τ）， 这支持 pivot (2)。对 pivot (1)，可 reframe 为\\\"G-MFRM 在污染弱的环境下 gracefully degrades 到 MFRM 水平而不损害性能——这正是框架的设计特性\\\"。\\n\\n\\nworst 档下所有方法的 τ 集中在 [0.81, 0.86] 的窄带内。G-MFRM（τ=0.851） 名义上最高，但与 sequential（0.845）和 MFRM-only（0.843）的差异不显著 （p=0.28, 0.31）。Bootstrap 95% CI 跨零（[-0.008, 0.021]）。 关键观察：(a) raw average → MFRM-only 的提升（0.812→0.843, +0.031） 是所有比较中最大且显著的，说明 judge bias 校正有真实价值； (b) MFRM-only → sequential → G-MFRM 的增量极小（0.843→0.845→0.851）， 说明 contamination 校正层在真实数据上几乎不贡献； (c) CyclicJudge（0.838）略低于 MFRM，因为 round-robin 丢弃了非循环数据； (d) DCR/Pref Leakage 仅做 contamination 调整，对 judge bias 无帮助， 表现接近 raw average；(e) UDA（0.841）接近 MFRM，其神经 K-factor 调整在实质上也是做 judge severity 校正。 整体格局：judge bias 校正是真实有效的改进来源，contamination 校正 在当前数据上不贡献增量。\\n\"\n316\t  },\n317\t  {\n318\t    \"name\": \"contamination_magnitude_calibration\",\n319\t    \"description\": \"将 exp-003 拟合的 c_n 与 MVP 合成假设对比，确定真实污染量级。\\n\",\n320\t    \"results\": {\n321\t      \"real_c_n_mean\": 0.14,\n322\t      \"real_c_n_median\": 0.09,\n323\t      \"real_c_n_std\": 0.11,\n324\t      \"real_c_n_max\": 0.38,\n325\t      \"real_c_n_interquartile_range\": [\n326\t        0.04,\n327\t        0.22\n328\t      ],\n329\t      \"closest_mvp_scenario\": \"mvp_001\",\n330\t      \"ratio_real_vs_mvp001_c_mean\": 0.28,\n331\t      \"ratio_real_vs_mvp002_c_mean\": 0.09,\n332\t      \"num_models_c_gt_0.3\": 2,\n333\t      \"num_models_c_gt_0.5\": 0,\n334\t      \"confounding_theta_rmse_degradation_pct\": 2.1,\n335\t      \"scatter_pearson_r_seq_bias\": 0.11\n336\t    },\n337\t    \"tables\": [\n338\t      {\n339\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: Contamination Magnitude Calibration\",\n340\t        \"columns\": [\n341\t          \"scenario\",\n342\t          \"c_mean\",\n343\t          \"c_std\",\n344\t          \"θ-RMSE degradation %\",\n345\t          \"bias scatter r\",\n346\t          \"Wilcoxon p\"\n347\t        ],\n348\t        \"rows\": [\n349\t          [\n350\t            \"Real Data\",\n351\t            0.14,\n352\t            0.11,\n353\t            2.1,\n354\t            0.11,\n355\t            0.34\n356\t          ],\n357\t          [\n358\t            \"mvp_001 (synthetic weak)\",\n359\t            0.5,\n360\t            0.25,\n361\t            0.0,\n362\t            0.05,\n363\t            0.48\n364\t          ],\n365\t          [\n366\t            \"mvp_002 (synthetic strong\",\n367\t            \"pre-fix)\",\n368\t            1.5,\n369\t            0.5,\n370\t            \"—\",\n371\t            0.65,\n372\t            \"1e-6\"\n373\t          ],\n374\t          [\n375\t            \"mvp_003 (synthetic strong\",\n376\t            \"fixed)\",\n377\t            1.5,\n378\t            0.5,\n379\t            43.8,\n380\t            0.65,\n381\t            \"1e-6\"\n382\t          ]\n383\t        ]\n384\t      }\n385\t    ],\n386\t    \"figures\": [],\n387\t    \"analysis\": \"这是论文 framing 的决定性实验。结果明确否定了原始 confounding claim 的 实证基础。但这个\\\"negative result\\\"本身有价值：它是 G-MFRM 框架给出的 实证诊断结论——\\\"截至 2026 年中，主流 LLM 的 benchmark 污染已被缓解到 不足以产生可观测 confounding 的水平\\\"。Figure 5 的 landscape 图特别有用： 它展示了 confounding 何时会成为问题（c_mean > 0.8），以及当前数据距离 该阈值有多远。这支持 pivot (1) \\\"Diagnostic Framework\\\" 角度。\\n\\n\\nc̄=0.14 远低于 mvp_001 的 c̄~0.5，甚至比 mvp_001 的最弱设定还低。 仅 2/22 模型的 c_n > 0.3，没有模型达到 0.5。这意味着即使在 mvp_001 那个已被判定为 FAIL 的合成场景中，污染信号也比真实数据强约 3.5 倍。 confounding 导致的 θ-RMSE degradation 仅 2.1%（mvp_003 中为 43.8%）， 说明 confounding 通道在真实数据上近乎关闭。Sequential bias scatter 的 Pearson r=0.11（mvp_003 中为 0.65），说明 sequential 估计器的系统性 偏差在真实数据上不可观测——d_j 和 c_n·e_i 在真实数据上近似正交 （因为 c_n 和 e_i 都太小，乘积项的方差可忽略）。 结论明确：真实数据远在 mvp_001 以下，原始 confounding claim 在实证上不成立。\\n\"\n388\t  },\n389\t  {\n390\t    \"name\": \"judge_count_sensitivity\",\n391\t    \"description\": \"变化 judge 数量（2, 4, 6, 8），测量 G-MFRM 相对于 sequential 的性能变化。\\n\",\n392\t    \"results\": {\n393\t      \"tau_gmfrm_2judges\": 0.803,\n394\t      \"tau_gmfrm_4judges\": 0.831,\n395\t      \"tau_gmfrm_6judges\": 0.844,\n396\t      \"tau_gmfrm_8judges\": 0.851,\n397\t      \"tau_sequential_2judges\": 0.798,\n398\t      \"tau_sequential_4judges\": 0.828,\n399\t      \"tau_sequential_6judges\": 0.841,\n400\t      \"tau_sequential_8judges\": 0.845,\n401\t      \"delta_tau_2judges\": 0.005,\n402\t      \"delta_tau_4judges\": 0.003,\n403\t      \"delta_tau_6judges\": 0.003,\n404\t      \"delta_tau_8judges\": 0.006,\n405\t      \"p_significant_at_any_count\": false,\n406\t      \"tau_mfrm_only_2judges\": 0.801,\n407\t      \"tau_mfrm_only_4judges\": 0.829,\n408\t      \"tau_mfrm_only_6judges\": 0.842,\n409\t      \"tau_mfrm_only_8judges\": 0.843,\n410\t      \"min_judges_for_mfrm_benefit\": 3\n411\t    },\n412\t    \"tables\": [\n413\t      {\n414\t        \"name\": \"Table S5: Judge Count Sensitivity\",\n415\t        \"columns\": [\n416\t          \"num_judges\",\n417\t          \"τ Raw Avg\",\n418\t          \"τ MFRM\",\n419\t          \"τ Sequential\",\n420\t          \"τ G-MFRM\",\n421\t          \"Δτ G-MFRM vs Seq\",\n422\t          \"p-value\"\n423\t        ],\n424\t        \"rows\": [\n425\t          [\n426\t            2,\n427\t            0.778,\n428\t            0.801,\n429\t            0.798,\n430\t            0.803,\n431\t            0.005,\n432\t            0.61\n433\t          ],\n434\t          [\n435\t            4,\n436\t            0.802,\n437\t            0.829,\n438\t            0.828,\n439\t            0.831,\n440\t            0.003,\n441\t            0.72\n442\t          ],\n443\t          [\n444\t            6,\n445\t            0.81,\n446\t            0.842,\n447\t            0.841,\n448\t            0.844,\n449\t            0.003,\n450\t            0.68\n451\t          ],\n452\t          [\n453\t            8,\n454\t            0.812,\n455\t            0.843,\n456\t            0.845,\n457\t            0.851,\n458\t            0.006,\n459\t            0.28\n460\t          ]\n461\t        ]\n462\t      }\n463\t    ],\n464\t    \"figures\": [],\n465\t    \"analysis\": \"结果展示 MFRM 的 judge bias 校正是性能提升的唯一来源，且 4+ judges 时 已接近饱和。G-MFRM 的 contamination 通道在任何 judge count 下都不贡献。 对论文有用的正面发现：MFRM 在仅 3-4 judges 时就有显著提升，这对实际 评估场景（judge 资源有限）是实用性结论。可纳入 pivot (2) 的实用性讨论。\\n\\n\\n在 worst 档下，G-MFRM 在所有 judge 数量上都与 sequential 和 MFRM-only 无显著差异——因为 contamination 校正层始终不贡献。judge 数量的主要效应 是对 MFRM 部分（d_j 估计精度）的：2 judges 时 d_j 估计不稳定，τ 下降； 4+ judges 时 MFRM 已接近饱和。G-MFRM 和 MFRM-only 在每个 judge count 水平上几乎相同（差异 < 0.01），再次确认 contamination 通道无贡献。 G-MFRM 在 2 judges 时的 R̂ 可能升至 1.08-1.10（c_n 更难识别）， 但因为 c_n 估计本就不影响输出，这不改变结论。\\n\"\n466\t  },\n467\t  {\n468\t    \"name\": \"exposure_indicator_ablation\",\n469\t    \"description\": \"Leave-one-out 消融：逐一移除 exposure indicator（ConStat, temporal, LogProber）， 评估对 e_i 估计和最终 G-MFRM 性能的影响。\\n\",\n470\t    \"results\": {\n471\t      \"full_composite_tau\": 0.851,\n472\t      \"drop_constat_tau\": 0.849,\n473\t      \"drop_temporal_tau\": 0.85,\n474\t      \"drop_logprober_tau\": 0.851,\n475\t      \"constat_only_tau\": 0.85,\n476\t      \"temporal_only_tau\": 0.848,\n477\t      \"logprober_only_tau\": 0.849,\n478\t      \"no_exposure_tau\": 0.843,\n479\t      \"max_tau_drop_any_indicator\": 0.003,\n480\t      \"e_i_rank_correlation_full_vs_drop_constat\": 0.72,\n481\t      \"e_i_rank_correlation_full_vs_drop_temporal\": 0.88,\n482\t      \"e_i_rank_correlation_full_vs_drop_logprober\": 0.91\n483\t    },\n484\t    \"tables\": [\n485\t      {\n486\t        \"name\": \"Table S6: Exposure Indicator Ablation\",\n487\t        \"columns\": [\n488\t          \"configuration\",\n489\t          \"e_i rank corr with full\",\n490\t          \"τ Arena\",\n491\t          \"Δτ vs full\"\n492\t        ],\n493\t        \"rows\": [\n494\t          [\n495\t            \"Full composite\",\n496\t            1.0,\n497\t            0.851,\n498\t            0.0\n499\t          ],\n500\t          [\n501\t            \"Drop ConStat\",\n502\t            0.72,\n503\t            0.849,\n504\t            -0.002\n505\t          ],\n506\t          [\n507\t            \"Drop temporal\",\n508\t            0.88,\n509\t            0.85,\n510\t            -0.001\n511\t          ],\n512\t          [\n513\t            \"Drop LogProber\",\n514\t            0.91,\n515\t            0.851,\n516\t            0.0\n517\t          ],\n518\t          [\n519\t            \"ConStat only\",\n520\t            \"—\",\n521\t            0.85,\n522\t            -0.001\n523\t          ],\n524\t          [\n525\t            \"Temporal only\",\n526\t            \"—\",\n527\t            0.848,\n528\t            -0.003\n529\t          ],\n530\t          [\n531\t            \"LogProber only\",\n532\t            \"—\",\n533\t            0.849,\n534\t            -0.002\n535\t          ],\n536\t          [\n537\t            \"No exposure (MFRM-only)\",\n538\t            \"—\",\n539\t            0.843,\n540\t            -0.008\n541\t          ]\n542\t        ]\n543\t      }\n544\t    ],\n545\t    \"figures\": [],\n546\t    \"analysis\": \"消融结果进一步确认 exposure 通道在真实数据上信息量不足。 但对 pivot (1) 可 reframe 为：消融展示了 G-MFRM 的鲁棒性—— 当 exposure indicator 质量不同时，框架不依赖于任何单一 indicator， 且当污染信号弱时自动退化为 MFRM 而不引入噪声。\\n\\n\\nworst 档下 exposure indicator 消融几乎不影响最终 τ——因为 e_i 信号 本身就弱，c_n 先验主导后验，gating 通道近乎关闭。移除任何单个 indicator 导致的 τ 变化 ≤ 0.003，远在噪声范围内。不同 indicator 之间的 rank correlation 也不高（full vs drop-ConStat = 0.72）， 说明各 indicator 在弱信号下捕捉的是不同的噪声分量而非一致的污染信号。 唯一显著的 drop 是移除全部 exposure（no_exposure_tau=0.843，即 MFRM-only），这恰好是因为移除了整个 Stage 3——但这只是回退到 Stage 1 MFRM，不是因为 exposure 信息有价值。\\n\"\n547\t  },\n548\t  {\n549\t    \"name\": \"facet_fit_diagnostics\",\n550\t    \"description\": \"报告所有 facet（θ, b, d, c）的 infit/outfit MNSQ，标记 misfit 元素， 比较 Stage 1 person-fit 指标与 Stage 3 c_n。\\n\",\n551\t    \"results\": {\n552\t      \"theta_infit_mean\": 1.02,\n553\t      \"theta_infit_range\": [\n554\t        0.78,\n555\t        1.31\n556\t      ],\n557\t      \"theta_misfit_count\": 1,\n558\t      \"b_infit_mean\": 1.0,\n559\t      \"b_infit_range\": [\n560\t        0.72,\n561\t        1.45\n562\t      ],\n563\t      \"b_misfit_count\": 28,\n564\t      \"d_infit_mean\": 0.98,\n565\t      \"d_infit_range\": [\n566\t        0.85,\n567\t        1.12\n568\t      ],\n569\t      \"d_misfit_count\": 0,\n570\t      \"c_n_infit_mean\": 1.05,\n571\t      \"c_n_infit_range\": [\n572\t        0.6,\n573\t        1.82\n574\t      ],\n575\t      \"c_n_misfit_count\": 5,\n576\t      \"lz_vs_c_n_correlation\": 0.18,\n577\t      \"emri_vs_c_n_correlation\": 0.12,\n578\t      \"stage1_person_fit_flagged_models\": 3,\n579\t      \"stage3_c_n_flagged_models\": 2,\n580\t      \"overlap_flagged\": 1\n581\t    },\n582\t    \"tables\": [\n583\t      {\n584\t        \"name\": \"Table S7: Facet Fit Summary\",\n585\t        \"columns\": [\n586\t          \"facet\",\n587\t          \"n_elements\",\n588\t          \"infit_mean\",\n589\t          \"infit_range\",\n590\t          \"outfit_mean\",\n591\t          \"outfit_range\",\n592\t          \"misfit_count\",\n593\t          \"misfit_pct\"\n594\t        ],\n595\t        \"rows\": [\n596\t          [\n597\t            \"θ (ability)\",\n598\t            22,\n599\t            1.02,\n600\t            \"0.78–1.31\",\n601\t            1.04,\n602\t            \"0.72–1.38\",\n603\t            1,\n604\t            4.5\n605\t          ],\n606\t          [\n607\t            \"b (difficulty)\",\n608\t            580,\n609\t            1.0,\n610\t            \"0.72–1.45\",\n611\t            1.02,\n612\t            \"0.65–1.68\",\n613\t            28,\n614\t            4.8\n615\t          ],\n616\t          [\n617\t            \"d (severity)\",\n618\t            8,\n619\t            0.98,\n620\t            \"0.85–1.12\",\n621\t            0.99,\n622\t            \"0.82–1.15\",\n623\t            0,\n624\t            0.0\n625\t          ],\n626\t          [\n627\t            \"c (contamination)\",\n628\t            22,\n629\t            1.05,\n630\t            \"0.60–1.82\",\n631\t            1.08,\n632\t            \"0.55–2.01\",\n633\t            5,\n634\t            22.7\n635\t          ]\n636\t        ]\n637\t      }\n638\t    ],\n639\t    \"figures\": [],\n640\t    \"analysis\": \"d_j 的优良 fit（0 misfit, 窄 range）是最有价值的发现——说明 MFRM 对 judge severity 的建模在测量学意义上是可靠的。c_n 的高 misfit 率 （22.7%）和宽 infit range 进一步表明 contamination facet 在数据中 不是一个良定义的构念（construct）。对 pivot (2) 有力支持：d_j 是 可靠的、有意义的测量维度，可作为论文核心贡献。\\n\\n\\nθ 和 d 的 fit 良好（infit MNSQ 在 [0.7, 1.3] 的可接受范围内）， 说明 MFRM 对 ability 和 judge severity 的建模是充分的。b（item difficulty） 有 28 个 misfit items（约 5%），这在 580 个 items 中是正常水平—— 部分 items 可能有多维性或猜测行为。c_n 的 infit 分布更宽（range 达到 [0.60, 1.82]），5 个模型 misfit——但因为 c_n 先验主导后验， infit 的解释力有限（计算 infit 需要的 expected response 依赖于 c_n 估计，而 c_n 本身不可靠）。lz 和 EMRi 与 c_n 的 correlation 极低（0.18, 0.12），说明 Stage 1 的 person misfit 信号与 Stage 3 的 contamination 估计基本不相关——进一步确认 c_n 不携带有意义的信息。\\n\"\n641\t  },\n642\t  {\n643\t    \"name\": \"confounding_formal_proposition\",\n644\t    \"description\": \"推导 sequential estimator 在 d_j/c_n·e_i 非正交条件下的一阶偏差近似。 Monte Carlo 模拟验证理论预测。\\n\",\n645\t    \"results\": {\n646\t      \"proposition_holds\": true,\n647\t      \"bias_formula_validated\": true,\n648\t      \"monte_carlo_n_settings\": 120,\n649\t      \"bias_direction_correct_pct\": 97.2,\n650\t      \"bias_magnitude_relative_error_mean\": 0.08,\n651\t      \"bias_magnitude_relative_error_std\": 0.05,\n652\t      \"critical_rho_threshold\": 0.15,\n653\t      \"critical_c_mean_threshold\": 0.6,\n654\t      \"bias_negligible_below_c_mean\": 0.4,\n655\t      \"type1_error_rate\": 0.048\n656\t    },\n657\t    \"tables\": [\n658\t      {\n659\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Confounding Bias — Theoretical vs Monte Carlo\",\n660\t        \"columns\": [\n661\t          \"c_mean\",\n662\t          \"rho\",\n663\t          \"bias_theory\",\n664\t          \"bias_MC_mean\",\n665\t          \"bias_MC_std\",\n666\t          \"θ-RMSE degradation %\"\n667\t        ],\n668\t        \"rows\": [\n669\t          [\n670\t            0.2,\n671\t            0.3,\n672\t            0.003,\n673\t            0.004,\n674\t            0.002,\n675\t            0.8\n676\t          ],\n677\t          [\n678\t            0.2,\n679\t            0.6,\n680\t            0.007,\n681\t            0.008,\n682\t            0.003,\n683\t            1.9\n684\t          ],\n685\t          [\n686\t            0.5,\n687\t            0.3,\n688\t            0.019,\n689\t            0.021,\n690\t            0.006,\n691\t            5.2\n692\t          ],\n693\t          [\n694\t            0.5,\n695\t            0.6,\n696\t            0.041,\n697\t            0.044,\n698\t            0.009,\n699\t            12.7\n700\t          ],\n701\t          [\n702\t            1.0,\n703\t            0.3,\n704\t            0.078,\n705\t            0.082,\n706\t            0.015,\n707\t            24.1\n708\t          ],\n709\t          [\n710\t            1.0,\n711\t            0.6,\n712\t            0.163,\n713\t            0.171,\n714\t            0.028,\n715\t            43.5\n716\t          ],\n717\t          [\n718\t            1.5,\n719\t            0.6,\n720\t            0.245,\n721\t            0.258,\n722\t            0.041,\n723\t            67.2\n724\t          ]\n725\t        ]\n726\t      }\n727\t    ],\n728\t    \"figures\": [],\n729\t    \"analysis\": \"exp-009 是 worst 档下价值最高的实验。它将原始的\\\"confounding 是现实问题\\\" 转化为\\\"confounding 是条件性问题——我们精确刻画了何时会发生\\\"。 heatmap（Figure 1）成为论文最核心的可视化：当前真实数据落在安全区域， 但随着未来模型训练策略变化（更多 benchmark 数据泄露），confounding 可能重新激活。这完美支撑 pivot (1) \\\"Diagnostic Framework\\\"： G-MFRM 是一个\\\"恒温器\\\"——当温度低时显示安全，当温度升高时自动切换 到校正模式。formal proposition + Monte Carlo validation 是不依赖 实证量级的方法论贡献。\\n\\n\\n形式命题是纯数学结果，不依赖真实数据量级——在 worst 档下仍然成立。 Monte Carlo 验证覆盖 120 个参数设定（c_mean × ρ × N × J 的网格）， 偏差方向预测准确率 97.2%，量级相对误差 8%——理论近似在常规参数范围 内有效。关键发现：偏差在 ρ > 0.15 且 c_mean > 0.6 时才变得实质性 显著（> 5% RMSE degradation）。当 c_mean < 0.4（worst 档的真实数据范围）， 即使 ρ=0.6，偏差也可忽略——这恰好解释了为什么 exp-005 发现真实数据上 confounding 不可观测。命题本身仍有价值：它精确描述了 confounding 何时 会成为问题，为未来监测提供了定量阈值。\\n\"\n730\t  },\n731\t  {\n732\t    \"name\": \"wildbench_replication\",\n733\t    \"description\": \"在 WildBench 上复制 G-MFRM pipeline，检验跨 benchmark 泛化性。\\n\",\n734\t    \"results\": {\n735\t      \"wildbench_raw_avg_tau\": 0.795,\n736\t      \"wildbench_mfrm_tau\": 0.826,\n737\t      \"wildbench_sequential_tau\": 0.828,\n738\t      \"wildbench_gmfrm_tau\": 0.832,\n739\t      \"wildbench_delta_gmfrm_vs_seq\": 0.004,\n740\t      \"wildbench_wilcoxon_p\": 0.42,\n741\t      \"wildbench_c_n_mean\": 0.11,\n742\t      \"wildbench_c_n_covers_zero_pct\": 82,\n743\t      \"cross_benchmark_c_n_correlation\": 0.35,\n744\t      \"cross_benchmark_d_j_correlation\": 0.78\n745\t    },\n746\t    \"tables\": [\n747\t      {\n748\t        \"name\": \"Table S8: WildBench Replication Results\",\n749\t        \"columns\": [\n750\t          \"method\",\n751\t          \"WildBench τ\",\n752\t          \"MT-Bench τ\",\n753\t          \"Arena-Hard τ\",\n754\t          \"Average τ\"\n755\t        ],\n756\t        \"rows\": [\n757\t          [\n758\t            \"Raw Average\",\n759\t            0.795,\n760\t            0.801,\n761\t            0.823,\n762\t            0.806\n763\t          ],\n764\t          [\n765\t            \"MFRM-only\",\n766\t            0.826,\n767\t            0.836,\n768\t            0.85,\n769\t            0.837\n770\t          ],\n771\t          [\n772\t            \"Sequential\",\n773\t            0.828,\n774\t            0.839,\n775\t            0.851,\n776\t            0.839\n777\t          ],\n778\t          [\n779\t            \"G-MFRM\",\n780\t            0.832,\n781\t            0.845,\n782\t            0.857,\n783\t            0.845\n784\t          ]\n785\t        ]\n786\t      }\n787\t    ],\n788\t    \"figures\": [],\n789\t    \"analysis\": \"WildBench 复制完全符合 worst 档预期。c_n 跨 benchmark 不稳定（r=0.35） vs d_j 跨 benchmark 一致（r=0.78）是一个有力的对比——可论证 d_j 是可靠的测量维度而 c_n 在当前数据上不是。这同时支持 pivot (1) 和 (2)。\\n\\n\\nWildBench 的污染量级预期更低（c̄=0.11 vs MT-Bench/Arena-Hard 的 0.14）， 因为 WildBench 是较新的 benchmark，训练数据泄露更少。G-MFRM 与 sequential 的差异同样不显著（p=0.42）。跨 benchmark 的 c_n correlation 仅 0.35——如果 c_n 反映真实污染，不同 benchmark 上同一模型的 c_n 应正相关，0.35 说明 c_n 主要是噪声。但 d_j 跨 benchmark correlation 达到 0.78——judge severity 是 judge 的稳定属性，跨 benchmark 一致—— 这进一步支持 d_j 作为有意义构念、c_n 作为噪声的解读。\\n\"\n790\t  },\n791\t  {\n792\t    \"name\": \"adversarial_robustness\",\n793\t    \"description\": \"测试 G-MFRM 对抗对抗性污染的鲁棒性（Wang et al. ICLR 2026 的 fragility attack）。\\n\",\n794\t    \"results\": {\n795\t      \"adversarial_gmfrm_tau\": 0.871,\n796\t      \"adversarial_sequential_tau\": 0.831,\n797\t      \"adversarial_raw_avg_tau\": 0.78,\n798\t      \"adversarial_delta_gmfrm_vs_seq\": 0.04,\n799\t      \"adversarial_wilcoxon_p\": 0.008,\n800\t      \"adversarial_c_n_recovery_correlation\": 0.82,\n801\t      \"adversarial_c_n_mean_injected\": 0.91,\n802\t      \"adversarial_c_n_mean_clean\": 0.1,\n803\t      \"adversarial_convergence_max_rhat\": 1.03,\n804\t      \"adversarial_convergence_min_ess\": 195\n805\t    },\n806\t    \"tables\": [\n807\t      {\n808\t        \"name\": \"Table S9: Adversarial Robustness — Clean vs Injected\",\n809\t        \"columns\": [\n810\t          \"setting\",\n811\t          \"τ Raw Avg\",\n812\t          \"τ MFRM\",\n813\t          \"τ Sequential\",\n814\t          \"τ G-MFRM\",\n815\t          \"Δτ G-MFRM vs Seq\",\n816\t          \"p-value\"\n817\t        ],\n818\t        \"rows\": [\n819\t          [\n820\t            \"Clean (natural)\",\n821\t            0.812,\n822\t            0.843,\n823\t            0.845,\n824\t            0.851,\n825\t            0.006,\n826\t            0.28\n827\t          ],\n828\t          [\n829\t            \"Adversarial (5 models injected)\",\n830\t            0.78,\n831\t            0.821,\n832\t            0.831,\n833\t            0.871,\n834\t            0.04,\n835\t            0.008\n836\t          ]\n837\t        ]\n838\t      },\n839\t      {\n840\t        \"name\": \"Table S10: c_n Recovery Under Adversarial Injection\",\n841\t        \"columns\": [\n842\t          \"model_group\",\n843\t          \"n_models\",\n844\t          \"true_c_mean\",\n845\t          \"estimated_c_mean\",\n846\t          \"recovery_corr\"\n847\t        ],\n848\t        \"rows\": [\n849\t          [\n850\t            \"Injected\",\n851\t            5,\n852\t            1.0,\n853\t            0.91,\n854\t            0.82\n855\t          ],\n856\t          [\n857\t            \"Clean\",\n858\t            17,\n859\t            0.0,\n860\t            0.1,\n861\t            \"—\"\n862\t          ]\n863\t        ]\n864\t      }\n865\t    ],\n866\t    \"figures\": [],\n867\t    \"analysis\": \"adversarial experiment 是 worst 档下的关键 \\\"silver lining\\\"。 它证明 G-MFRM 方法论上是正确的——检测和校正机制在信号充分时有效—— 只是当前真实数据的信号不足。这完美支撑 pivot (1)：G-MFRM 是一个 \\\"备战\\\"框架——当前安全但已验证可在威胁升级时启动。 结合 pivot (3) \\\"Controlled Contamination Injection\\\"，adversarial experiment 可作为受控验证的自然延伸。\\n\\n在人工注入强污染（c_n ≈ 1.0, 5 个模型 fine-tuned on benchmark）后， G-MFRM 重新获得显著优势：τ=0.871 vs sequential 的 0.831（p=0.008）， RMSE reduction ~32%——接近 mvp_003 的合成结果。c_n recovery correlation 达到 0.82（因为注入的污染足够强，c_n 后验能从先验中拉出）。 收敛也改善（R̂=1.03, ESS=195）——数据中有足够信息驱动 c_n 估计。 这证明 G-MFRM 的检测和校正机制在信号充分时确实有效——问题不是方法 不工作，而是当前真实数据中信号不够强。adversarial experiment 同时 验证了 exp-009 的理论预测：当 c_mean 提升到 ~1.0 时，confounding 变得显著，G-MFRM 的联合估计优势重新显现。\\n\"\n868\t  }\n869\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f762910b-0e14-4be4-bd77-f63c53231d74","uuid":"12e1eea6-7e0a-4d43-a6a1-cba0ceae243e","timestamp":"2026-05-21T21:11:20.388Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T204917/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"multi_judge_data_collection\",\n    \"description\": \"收集 8 judge × 20+ target models 在 MT-Bench 和 Arena-Hard 上的多评委评分数据。 Position swap 后总评估量约 8×20×2×(80+500)=185,600 次。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"num_judges\": 8,\n      \"num_target_models\": 22,\n      \"num_benchmarks\": 2,\n      \"total_evaluations\": \"~186000\",\n      \"api_cost_usd\": 870,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 118,\n      \"missing_rate_pct\": 1.2,\n      \"inter_judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa\": 0.38,\n      \"position_bias_swap_disagreement_pct\": 14.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A1: Data Collection Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"num_items\",\n          \"num_judges\",\n          \"num_models\",\n          \"total_evals\",\n          \"missing_pct\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MT-Bench\",\n            80,\n            8,\n            22,\n            28160,\n            0.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Arena-Hard\",\n            500,\n            8,\n            22,\n            176000,\n            1.3\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"数据收集是中性步骤。关键观察：judge severity 的变异足够大（κ~0.38）， 说明 MFRM 对 d_j 的建模有实质价值——这为 pivot (2) \\\"Judge Bias as Main Story\\\" 保留了空间。数据完整性和规模满足后续所有实验需求。\\n\\n\\n数据收集本身不受 contamination 量级影响，预期正常完成。 inter-judge agreement 中等偏低（κ~0.38）反映 LLM judge 间固有差异—— 这本身支持 MFRM 建模 judge severity 的必要性。Position swap disagreement ~14.5% 是 MT-Bench/Arena-Hard 上的典型值。数据质量足以支撑下游分析， 但不会改变\\\"真实污染弱\\\"的底层事实。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constat_exposure_estimation\",\n    \"description\": \"通过 ConStat 方法估计每个 benchmark item 的 exposure 指标 e_i： 生成参考变体（rephrased），计算 delta scores，结合 temporal signals。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"num_items_mtbench\": 80,\n      \"num_items_arenahard\": 500,\n      \"num_reference_variants_per_item\": 3,\n      \"constat_delta_mean\": 0.08,\n      \"constat_delta_std\": 0.12,\n      \"constat_delta_median\": 0.04,\n      \"items_with_significant_delta_pct\": 12.0,\n      \"rank_correlation_constat_vs_temporal\": 0.31,\n      \"human_equivalence_check_pass_rate_pct\": 89,\n      \"e_i_distribution_skewness\": 2.1,\n      \"effective_signal_items_pct\": 15\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S2: Exposure Indicator Statistics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"indicator\",\n          \"mean\",\n          \"std\",\n          \"median\",\n          \"pct_significant\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"ConStat_delta\",\n            0.08,\n            0.12,\n            0.04,\n            12.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"temporal_signal\",\n            0.05,\n            0.09,\n            0.02,\n            8.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"composite_e_i\",\n            0.07,\n            0.1,\n            0.03,\n            11.0\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"exposure 信号的整体微弱是 worst 档的核心特征之一。这并非方法论失败—— ConStat 在合成数据上 r²=0.94 是已验证的——而是反映真实数据中主流 LLM 的 benchmark 污染确实已被缓解（训练数据清洗、instruction tuning 策略改进）。 对 pivot (1) 有利：e_i 接近零本身就是 G-MFRM 框架产出的有价值诊断结论。 但对原始 framing 致命：没有足够的 exposure 变异来驱动 c_n 估计。\\n\\n\\nworst 档下，真实污染量级弱（c̄ < 0.4），大多数 item 的 ConStat delta 接近零（均值 0.08），因为模型在原题和变体上的表现差异主要来自噪声而非记忆。 仅约 12% 的 item 有统计显著的 delta——这些可能对应少数确实被泄露的题目， 但整体 exposure 信号微弱。e_i 分布高度右偏（skewness=2.1）：绝大多数 item 的 e_i 接近零，少数 item 有中等信号。ConStat 与 temporal signal 的 rank correlation 仅 0.31，说明两个 indicator 捕捉的是不同维度的噪声 而非一致的污染信号。参考变体的人工等价性检查通过率 89% 是可接受的， 说明变体质量不是瓶颈——问题在于污染本身就弱。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gmfrm_real_data_fit\",\n    \"description\": \"在 exp-001/002 的真实数据上拟合 G-MFRM 三阶段流程。 Stage 1: MFRM 估计 θ,b,d。Stage 2: 使用 exp-002 的 e_i。 Stage 3: Joint gated model。与 Chatbot Arena 人类投票比较。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"stage1_convergence_max_rhat\": 1.01,\n      \"stage1_convergence_min_ess\": 820,\n      \"stage1_kendall_tau_arena\": 0.843,\n      \"stage1_d_j_range\": [\n        -0.62,\n        0.71\n      ],\n      \"stage1_d_j_std\": 0.35,\n      \"stage3_convergence_max_rhat\": 1.06,\n      \"stage3_convergence_min_ess\": 112,\n      \"stage3_kendall_tau_arena\": 0.851,\n      \"c_n_posterior_mean\": 0.14,\n      \"c_n_posterior_std\": 0.11,\n      \"c_n_95ci_covers_zero_pct\": 78,\n      \"c_n_prior_posterior_kl_divergence\": 0.08,\n      \"delta_tau_stage3_vs_stage1\": 0.008,\n      \"wilcoxon_p_stage3_vs_stage1\": 0.34,\n      \"runtime_seconds\": 5200\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: G-MFRM Real Data Fit Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"stage\",\n          \"model\",\n          \"max_rhat\",\n          \"min_ess\",\n          \"tau_arena\",\n          \"num_params\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Stage 1\",\n            \"MFRM\",\n            1.01,\n            820,\n            0.843,\n            110\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Stage 3\",\n            \"G-MFRM Joint\",\n            1.06,\n            112,\n            0.851,\n            132\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S3: c_n Posterior Summary (Top 10 Models by c_n)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"c_n_mean\",\n          \"c_n_std\",\n          \"95%CI_lower\",\n          \"95%CI_upper\",\n          \"covers_zero\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"model_A\",\n            0.38,\n            0.15,\n            0.09,\n            0.67,\n            false\n          ],\n          [\n            \"model_B\",\n            0.31,\n            0.17,\n            -0.02,\n            0.64,\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"model_C\",\n            0.27,\n            0.14,\n            0.0,\n            0.54,\n            true\n          ],\n          [\n            \"...(remaining 19 models)\",\n            \"0.02–0.22\",\n            \"0.10–0.18\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"mostly true\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是 worst 档的决定性实验。c_n 先验主导后验是最核心的 red flag—— 说明真实数据中缺乏足够的污染信号来支撑 contamination 参数的估计。 G-MFRM 有效退化为 MFRM。但注意 Stage 1 MFRM 本身表现良好（τ=0.843）， d_j 估计有实质意义——这为 pivot (2) \\\"Judge Bias as Main Story\\\" 提供支撑。 收敛不佳但未完全失败（R̂=1.06 在边界内），可解释为\\\"模型参数化过度\\\" 而非\\\"模型错误\\\"。\\n\\n\\nStage 1 MFRM 收敛良好（R̂=1.01, ESS=820），因为 MFRM 是成熟模型， judge severity d_j 有充足数据支撑。Stage 1 的 τ=0.843 反映 MFRM 对 judge bias 的有效校正。Stage 3 joint model 收敛变差（R̂=1.06, ESS=112）——c_n 参数数据信息量不足时，MCMC 在先验附近 random walk， 链间混合慢。c_n 后验均值仅 0.14，78% 的模型 c_n 的 95% 可信区间 覆盖零，说明先验主导后验——数据中没有足够信号将 c_n 从先验拉开。 prior-posterior KL 仅 0.08 进一步确认这一点。Stage 3 的 τ=0.851 比 Stage 1 仅高 0.008，Wilcoxon p=0.34 远不显著。本质上 joint model 退化为一个带噪声 c_n 项的 MFRM——gating 机制因 e_i 信号弱而几乎 不激活，c_n 被先验钉在零附近，θ 估计基本等于 Stage 1 的 MFRM 估计。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"baseline_comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"在相同数据上比较 G-MFRM 与 7 个 baselines。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"raw_average_tau\": 0.812,\n      \"raw_average_spearman\": 0.847,\n      \"mfrm_only_tau\": 0.843,\n      \"mfrm_only_spearman\": 0.871,\n      \"sequential_tau\": 0.845,\n      \"sequential_spearman\": 0.873,\n      \"cyclicjudge_tau\": 0.838,\n      \"cyclicjudge_spearman\": 0.866,\n      \"dcr_factor_tau\": 0.819,\n      \"dcr_factor_spearman\": 0.853,\n      \"uda_tau\": 0.841,\n      \"uda_spearman\": 0.869,\n      \"pref_leakage_tau\": 0.824,\n      \"pref_leakage_spearman\": 0.858,\n      \"gmfrm_joint_tau\": 0.851,\n      \"gmfrm_joint_spearman\": 0.878,\n      \"delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline\": 0.006,\n      \"delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_sequential\": 0.006,\n      \"wilcoxon_p_gmfrm_vs_sequential\": 0.28,\n      \"wilcoxon_p_gmfrm_vs_mfrm\": 0.31,\n      \"bootstrap_95ci_delta_tau\": [\n        -0.008,\n        0.021\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Main Results — Kendall-τ with Chatbot Arena\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"MT-Bench τ\",\n          \"Arena-Hard τ\",\n          \"Average τ\",\n          \"Spearman ρ\",\n          \"p vs G-MFRM\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Raw Average\",\n            0.801,\n            0.823,\n            0.812,\n            0.847,\n            0.003\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MFRM-only\",\n            0.836,\n            0.85,\n            0.843,\n            0.871,\n            0.31\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Sequential (bias→contam)\",\n            0.839,\n            0.851,\n            0.845,\n            0.873,\n            0.28\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CyclicJudge\",\n            0.831,\n            0.845,\n            0.838,\n            0.866,\n            0.14\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DCR Factor\",\n            0.81,\n            0.828,\n            0.819,\n            0.853,\n            0.008\n          ],\n          [\n            \"UDA\",\n            0.834,\n            0.848,\n            0.841,\n            0.869,\n            0.22\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pref Leakage\",\n            0.815,\n            0.833,\n            0.824,\n            0.858,\n            0.012\n          ],\n          [\n            \"**G-MFRM (ours)**\",\n            \"**0.845**\",\n            \"**0.857**\",\n            \"**0.851**\",\n            \"**0.878**\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"主结果表无法支撑 Empirical Claim (claim 3) 的原始表述（\\\"higher agreement than all baselines\\\"）。G-MFRM 名义最优但不显著优于 MFRM-only 和 sequential。 但 MFRM 部分（judge bias 校正）相对 raw average 的改进是显著的（+0.031 τ）， 这支持 pivot (2)。对 pivot (1)，可 reframe 为\\\"G-MFRM 在污染弱的环境下 gracefully degrades 到 MFRM 水平而不损害性能——这正是框架的设计特性\\\"。\\n\\n\\nworst 档下所有方法的 τ 集中在 [0.81, 0.86] 的窄带内。G-MFRM（τ=0.851） 名义上最高，但与 sequential（0.845）和 MFRM-only（0.843）的差异不显著 （p=0.28, 0.31）。Bootstrap 95% CI 跨零（[-0.008, 0.021]）。 关键观察：(a) raw average → MFRM-only 的提升（0.812→0.843, +0.031） 是所有比较中最大且显著的，说明 judge bias 校正有真实价值； (b) MFRM-only → sequential → G-MFRM 的增量极小（0.843→0.845→0.851）， 说明 contamination 校正层在真实数据上几乎不贡献； (c) CyclicJudge（0.838）略低于 MFRM，因为 round-robin 丢弃了非循环数据； (d) DCR/Pref Leakage 仅做 contamination 调整，对 judge bias 无帮助， 表现接近 raw average；(e) UDA（0.841）接近 MFRM，其神经 K-factor 调整在实质上也是做 judge severity 校正。 整体格局：judge bias 校正是真实有效的改进来源，contamination 校正 在当前数据上不贡献增量。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"contamination_magnitude_calibration\",\n    \"description\": \"将 exp-003 拟合的 c_n 与 MVP 合成假设对比，确定真实污染量级。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"real_c_n_mean\": 0.14,\n      \"real_c_n_median\": 0.09,\n      \"real_c_n_std\": 0.11,\n      \"real_c_n_max\": 0.38,\n      \"real_c_n_interquartile_range\": [\n        0.04,\n        0.22\n      ],\n      \"closest_mvp_scenario\": \"mvp_001\",\n      \"ratio_real_vs_mvp001_c_mean\": 0.28,\n      \"ratio_real_vs_mvp002_c_mean\": 0.09,\n      \"num_models_c_gt_0.3\": 2,\n      \"num_models_c_gt_0.5\": 0,\n      \"confounding_theta_rmse_degradation_pct\": 2.1,\n      \"scatter_pearson_r_seq_bias\": 0.11\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: Contamination Magnitude Calibration\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"scenario\",\n          \"c_mean\",\n          \"c_std\",\n          \"θ-RMSE degradation %\",\n          \"bias scatter r\",\n          \"Wilcoxon p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Real Data\",\n            0.14,\n            0.11,\n            2.1,\n            0.11,\n            0.34\n          ],\n          [\n            \"mvp_001 (synthetic weak)\",\n            0.5,\n            0.25,\n            0.0,\n            0.05,\n            0.48\n          ],\n          [\n            \"mvp_002 (synthetic strong\",\n            \"pre-fix)\",\n            1.5,\n            0.5,\n            \"—\",\n            0.65,\n            \"1e-6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"mvp_003 (synthetic strong\",\n            \"fixed)\",\n            1.5,\n            0.5,\n            43.8,\n            0.65,\n            \"1e-6\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是论文 framing 的决定性实验。结果明确否定了原始 confounding claim 的 实证基础。但这个\\\"negative result\\\"本身有价值：它是 G-MFRM 框架给出的 实证诊断结论——\\\"截至 2026 年中，主流 LLM 的 benchmark 污染已被缓解到 不足以产生可观测 confounding 的水平\\\"。Figure 5 的 landscape 图特别有用： 它展示了 confounding 何时会成为问题（c_mean > 0.8），以及当前数据距离 该阈值有多远。这支持 pivot (1) \\\"Diagnostic Framework\\\" 角度。\\n\\n\\nc̄=0.14 远低于 mvp_001 的 c̄~0.5，甚至比 mvp_001 的最弱设定还低。 仅 2/22 模型的 c_n > 0.3，没有模型达到 0.5。这意味着即使在 mvp_001 那个已被判定为 FAIL 的合成场景中，污染信号也比真实数据强约 3.5 倍。 confounding 导致的 θ-RMSE degradation 仅 2.1%（mvp_003 中为 43.8%）， 说明 confounding 通道在真实数据上近乎关闭。Sequential bias scatter 的 Pearson r=0.11（mvp_003 中为 0.65），说明 sequential 估计器的系统性 偏差在真实数据上不可观测——d_j 和 c_n·e_i 在真实数据上近似正交 （因为 c_n 和 e_i 都太小，乘积项的方差可忽略）。 结论明确：真实数据远在 mvp_001 以下，原始 confounding claim 在实证上不成立。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"judge_count_sensitivity\",\n    \"description\": \"变化 judge 数量（2, 4, 6, 8），测量 G-MFRM 相对于 sequential 的性能变化。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"tau_gmfrm_2judges\": 0.803,\n      \"tau_gmfrm_4judges\": 0.831,\n      \"tau_gmfrm_6judges\": 0.844,\n      \"tau_gmfrm_8judges\": 0.851,\n      \"tau_sequential_2judges\": 0.798,\n      \"tau_sequential_4judges\": 0.828,\n      \"tau_sequential_6judges\": 0.841,\n      \"tau_sequential_8judges\": 0.845,\n      \"delta_tau_2judges\": 0.005,\n      \"delta_tau_4judges\": 0.003,\n      \"delta_tau_6judges\": 0.003,\n      \"delta_tau_8judges\": 0.006,\n      \"p_significant_at_any_count\": false,\n      \"tau_mfrm_only_2judges\": 0.801,\n      \"tau_mfrm_only_4judges\": 0.829,\n      \"tau_mfrm_only_6judges\": 0.842,\n      \"tau_mfrm_only_8judges\": 0.843,\n      \"min_judges_for_mfrm_benefit\": 3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S5: Judge Count Sensitivity\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"num_judges\",\n          \"τ Raw Avg\",\n          \"τ MFRM\",\n          \"τ Sequential\",\n          \"τ G-MFRM\",\n          \"Δτ G-MFRM vs Seq\",\n          \"p-value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            2,\n            0.778,\n            0.801,\n            0.798,\n            0.803,\n            0.005,\n            0.61\n          ],\n          [\n            4,\n            0.802,\n            0.829,\n            0.828,\n            0.831,\n            0.003,\n            0.72\n          ],\n          [\n            6,\n            0.81,\n            0.842,\n            0.841,\n            0.844,\n            0.003,\n            0.68\n          ],\n          [\n            8,\n            0.812,\n            0.843,\n            0.845,\n            0.851,\n            0.006,\n            0.28\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"结果展示 MFRM 的 judge bias 校正是性能提升的唯一来源，且 4+ judges 时 已接近饱和。G-MFRM 的 contamination 通道在任何 judge count 下都不贡献。 对论文有用的正面发现：MFRM 在仅 3-4 judges 时就有显著提升，这对实际 评估场景（judge 资源有限）是实用性结论。可纳入 pivot (2) 的实用性讨论。\\n\\n\\n在 worst 档下，G-MFRM 在所有 judge 数量上都与 sequential 和 MFRM-only 无显著差异——因为 contamination 校正层始终不贡献。judge 数量的主要效应 是对 MFRM 部分（d_j 估计精度）的：2 judges 时 d_j 估计不稳定，τ 下降； 4+ judges 时 MFRM 已接近饱和。G-MFRM 和 MFRM-only 在每个 judge count 水平上几乎相同（差异 < 0.01），再次确认 contamination 通道无贡献。 G-MFRM 在 2 judges 时的 R̂ 可能升至 1.08-1.10（c_n 更难识别）， 但因为 c_n 估计本就不影响输出，这不改变结论。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exposure_indicator_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"Leave-one-out 消融：逐一移除 exposure indicator（ConStat, temporal, LogProber）， 评估对 e_i 估计和最终 G-MFRM 性能的影响。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"full_composite_tau\": 0.851,\n      \"drop_constat_tau\": 0.849,\n      \"drop_temporal_tau\": 0.85,\n      \"drop_logprober_tau\": 0.851,\n      \"constat_only_tau\": 0.85,\n      \"temporal_only_tau\": 0.848,\n      \"logprober_only_tau\": 0.849,\n      \"no_exposure_tau\": 0.843,\n      \"max_tau_drop_any_indicator\": 0.003,\n      \"e_i_rank_correlation_full_vs_drop_constat\": 0.72,\n      \"e_i_rank_correlation_full_vs_drop_temporal\": 0.88,\n      \"e_i_rank_correlation_full_vs_drop_logprober\": 0.91\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S6: Exposure Indicator Ablation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"configuration\",\n          \"e_i rank corr with full\",\n          \"τ Arena\",\n          \"Δτ vs full\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Full composite\",\n            1.0,\n            0.851,\n            0.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Drop ConStat\",\n            0.72,\n            0.849,\n            -0.002\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Drop temporal\",\n            0.88,\n            0.85,\n            -0.001\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Drop LogProber\",\n            0.91,\n            0.851,\n            0.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat only\",\n            \"—\",\n            0.85,\n            -0.001\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Temporal only\",\n            \"—\",\n            0.848,\n            -0.003\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LogProber only\",\n            \"—\",\n            0.849,\n            -0.002\n          ],\n          [\n            \"No exposure (MFRM-only)\",\n            \"—\",\n            0.843,\n            -0.008\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"消融结果进一步确认 exposure 通道在真实数据上信息量不足。 但对 pivot (1) 可 reframe 为：消融展示了 G-MFRM 的鲁棒性—— 当 exposure indicator 质量不同时，框架不依赖于任何单一 indicator， 且当污染信号弱时自动退化为 MFRM 而不引入噪声。\\n\\n\\nworst 档下 exposure indicator 消融几乎不影响最终 τ——因为 e_i 信号 本身就弱，c_n 先验主导后验，gating 通道近乎关闭。移除任何单个 indicator 导致的 τ 变化 ≤ 0.003，远在噪声范围内。不同 indicator 之间的 rank correlation 也不高（full vs drop-ConStat = 0.72）， 说明各 indicator 在弱信号下捕捉的是不同的噪声分量而非一致的污染信号。 唯一显著的 drop 是移除全部 exposure（no_exposure_tau=0.843，即 MFRM-only），这恰好是因为移除了整个 Stage 3——但这只是回退到 Stage 1 MFRM，不是因为 exposure 信息有价值。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"facet_fit_diagnostics\",\n    \"description\": \"报告所有 facet（θ, b, d, c）的 infit/outfit MNSQ，标记 misfit 元素， 比较 Stage 1 person-fit 指标与 Stage 3 c_n。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"theta_infit_mean\": 1.02,\n      \"theta_infit_range\": [\n        0.78,\n        1.31\n      ],\n      \"theta_misfit_count\": 1,\n      \"b_infit_mean\": 1.0,\n      \"b_infit_range\": [\n        0.72,\n        1.45\n      ],\n      \"b_misfit_count\": 28,\n      \"d_infit_mean\": 0.98,\n      \"d_infit_range\": [\n        0.85,\n        1.12\n      ],\n      \"d_misfit_count\": 0,\n      \"c_n_infit_mean\": 1.05,\n      \"c_n_infit_range\": [\n        0.6,\n        1.82\n      ],\n      \"c_n_misfit_count\": 5,\n      \"lz_vs_c_n_correlation\": 0.18,\n      \"emri_vs_c_n_correlation\": 0.12,\n      \"stage1_person_fit_flagged_models\": 3,\n      \"stage3_c_n_flagged_models\": 2,\n      \"overlap_flagged\": 1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S7: Facet Fit Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"facet\",\n          \"n_elements\",\n          \"infit_mean\",\n          \"infit_range\",\n          \"outfit_mean\",\n          \"outfit_range\",\n          \"misfit_count\",\n          \"misfit_pct\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"θ (ability)\",\n            22,\n            1.02,\n            \"0.78–1.31\",\n            1.04,\n            \"0.72–1.38\",\n            1,\n            4.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"b (difficulty)\",\n            580,\n            1.0,\n            \"0.72–1.45\",\n            1.02,\n            \"0.65–1.68\",\n            28,\n            4.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"d (severity)\",\n            8,\n            0.98,\n            \"0.85–1.12\",\n            0.99,\n            \"0.82–1.15\",\n            0,\n            0.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"c (contamination)\",\n            22,\n            1.05,\n            \"0.60–1.82\",\n            1.08,\n            \"0.55–2.01\",\n            5,\n            22.7\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"d_j 的优良 fit（0 misfit, 窄 range）是最有价值的发现——说明 MFRM 对 judge severity 的建模在测量学意义上是可靠的。c_n 的高 misfit 率 （22.7%）和宽 infit range 进一步表明 contamination facet 在数据中 不是一个良定义的构念（construct）。对 pivot (2) 有力支持：d_j 是 可靠的、有意义的测量维度，可作为论文核心贡献。\\n\\n\\nθ 和 d 的 fit 良好（infit MNSQ 在 [0.7, 1.3] 的可接受范围内）， 说明 MFRM 对 ability 和 judge severity 的建模是充分的。b（item difficulty） 有 28 个 misfit items（约 5%），这在 580 个 items 中是正常水平—— 部分 items 可能有多维性或猜测行为。c_n 的 infit 分布更宽（range 达到 [0.60, 1.82]），5 个模型 misfit——但因为 c_n 先验主导后验， infit 的解释力有限（计算 infit 需要的 expected response 依赖于 c_n 估计，而 c_n 本身不可靠）。lz 和 EMRi 与 c_n 的 correlation 极低（0.18, 0.12），说明 Stage 1 的 person misfit 信号与 Stage 3 的 contamination 估计基本不相关——进一步确认 c_n 不携带有意义的信息。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"confounding_formal_proposition\",\n    \"description\": \"推导 sequential estimator 在 d_j/c_n·e_i 非正交条件下的一阶偏差近似。 Monte Carlo 模拟验证理论预测。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"proposition_holds\": true,\n      \"bias_formula_validated\": true,\n      \"monte_carlo_n_settings\": 120,\n      \"bias_direction_correct_pct\": 97.2,\n      \"bias_magnitude_relative_error_mean\": 0.08,\n      \"bias_magnitude_relative_error_std\": 0.05,\n      \"critical_rho_threshold\": 0.15,\n      \"critical_c_mean_threshold\": 0.6,\n      \"bias_negligible_below_c_mean\": 0.4,\n      \"type1_error_rate\": 0.048\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Confounding Bias — Theoretical vs Monte Carlo\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"c_mean\",\n          \"rho\",\n          \"bias_theory\",\n          \"bias_MC_mean\",\n          \"bias_MC_std\",\n          \"θ-RMSE degradation %\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            0.2,\n            0.3,\n            0.003,\n            0.004,\n            0.002,\n            0.8\n          ],\n          [\n            0.2,\n            0.6,\n            0.007,\n            0.008,\n            0.003,\n            1.9\n          ],\n          [\n            0.5,\n            0.3,\n            0.019,\n            0.021,\n            0.006,\n            5.2\n          ],\n          [\n            0.5,\n            0.6,\n            0.041,\n            0.044,\n            0.009,\n            12.7\n          ],\n          [\n            1.0,\n            0.3,\n            0.078,\n            0.082,\n            0.015,\n            24.1\n          ],\n          [\n            1.0,\n            0.6,\n            0.163,\n            0.171,\n            0.028,\n            43.5\n          ],\n          [\n            1.5,\n            0.6,\n            0.245,\n            0.258,\n            0.041,\n            67.2\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"exp-009 是 worst 档下价值最高的实验。它将原始的\\\"confounding 是现实问题\\\" 转化为\\\"confounding 是条件性问题——我们精确刻画了何时会发生\\\"。 heatmap（Figure 1）成为论文最核心的可视化：当前真实数据落在安全区域， 但随着未来模型训练策略变化（更多 benchmark 数据泄露），confounding 可能重新激活。这完美支撑 pivot (1) \\\"Diagnostic Framework\\\"： G-MFRM 是一个\\\"恒温器\\\"——当温度低时显示安全，当温度升高时自动切换 到校正模式。formal proposition + Monte Carlo validation 是不依赖 实证量级的方法论贡献。\\n\\n\\n形式命题是纯数学结果，不依赖真实数据量级——在 worst 档下仍然成立。 Monte Carlo 验证覆盖 120 个参数设定（c_mean × ρ × N × J 的网格）， 偏差方向预测准确率 97.2%，量级相对误差 8%——理论近似在常规参数范围 内有效。关键发现：偏差在 ρ > 0.15 且 c_mean > 0.6 时才变得实质性 显著（> 5% RMSE degradation）。当 c_mean < 0.4（worst 档的真实数据范围）， 即使 ρ=0.6，偏差也可忽略——这恰好解释了为什么 exp-005 发现真实数据上 confounding 不可观测。命题本身仍有价值：它精确描述了 confounding 何时 会成为问题，为未来监测提供了定量阈值。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"wildbench_replication\",\n    \"description\": \"在 WildBench 上复制 G-MFRM pipeline，检验跨 benchmark 泛化性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"wildbench_raw_avg_tau\": 0.795,\n      \"wildbench_mfrm_tau\": 0.826,\n      \"wildbench_sequential_tau\": 0.828,\n      \"wildbench_gmfrm_tau\": 0.832,\n      \"wildbench_delta_gmfrm_vs_seq\": 0.004,\n      \"wildbench_wilcoxon_p\": 0.42,\n      \"wildbench_c_n_mean\": 0.11,\n      \"wildbench_c_n_covers_zero_pct\": 82,\n      \"cross_benchmark_c_n_correlation\": 0.35,\n      \"cross_benchmark_d_j_correlation\": 0.78\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S8: WildBench Replication Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"WildBench τ\",\n          \"MT-Bench τ\",\n          \"Arena-Hard τ\",\n          \"Average τ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Raw Average\",\n            0.795,\n            0.801,\n            0.823,\n            0.806\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MFRM-only\",\n            0.826,\n            0.836,\n            0.85,\n            0.837\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Sequential\",\n            0.828,\n            0.839,\n            0.851,\n            0.839\n          ],\n          [\n            \"G-MFRM\",\n            0.832,\n            0.845,\n            0.857,\n            0.845\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"WildBench 复制完全符合 worst 档预期。c_n 跨 benchmark 不稳定（r=0.35） vs d_j 跨 benchmark 一致（r=0.78）是一个有力的对比——可论证 d_j 是可靠的测量维度而 c_n 在当前数据上不是。这同时支持 pivot (1) 和 (2)。\\n\\n\\nWildBench 的污染量级预期更低（c̄=0.11 vs MT-Bench/Arena-Hard 的 0.14）， 因为 WildBench 是较新的 benchmark，训练数据泄露更少。G-MFRM 与 sequential 的差异同样不显著（p=0.42）。跨 benchmark 的 c_n correlation 仅 0.35——如果 c_n 反映真实污染，不同 benchmark 上同一模型的 c_n 应正相关，0.35 说明 c_n 主要是噪声。但 d_j 跨 benchmark correlation 达到 0.78——judge severity 是 judge 的稳定属性，跨 benchmark 一致—— 这进一步支持 d_j 作为有意义构念、c_n 作为噪声的解读。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"adversarial_robustness\",\n    \"description\": \"测试 G-MFRM 对抗对抗性污染的鲁棒性（Wang et al. ICLR 2026 的 fragility attack）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"adversarial_gmfrm_tau\": 0.871,\n      \"adversarial_sequential_tau\": 0.831,\n      \"adversarial_raw_avg_tau\": 0.78,\n      \"adversarial_delta_gmfrm_vs_seq\": 0.04,\n      \"adversarial_wilcoxon_p\": 0.008,\n      \"adversarial_c_n_recovery_correlation\": 0.82,\n      \"adversarial_c_n_mean_injected\": 0.91,\n      \"adversarial_c_n_mean_clean\": 0.1,\n      \"adversarial_convergence_max_rhat\": 1.03,\n      \"adversarial_convergence_min_ess\": 195\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S9: Adversarial Robustness — Clean vs Injected\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"setting\",\n          \"τ Raw Avg\",\n          \"τ MFRM\",\n          \"τ Sequential\",\n          \"τ G-MFRM\",\n          \"Δτ G-MFRM vs Seq\",\n          \"p-value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Clean (natural)\",\n            0.812,\n            0.843,\n            0.845,\n            0.851,\n            0.006,\n            0.28\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Adversarial (5 models injected)\",\n            0.78,\n            0.821,\n            0.831,\n            0.871,\n            0.04,\n            0.008\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S10: c_n Recovery Under Adversarial Injection\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model_group\",\n          \"n_models\",\n          \"true_c_mean\",\n          \"estimated_c_mean\",\n          \"recovery_corr\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Injected\",\n            5,\n            1.0,\n            0.91,\n            0.82\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Clean\",\n            17,\n            0.0,\n            0.1,\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"adversarial experiment 是 worst 档下的关键 \\\"silver lining\\\"。 它证明 G-MFRM 方法论上是正确的——检测和校正机制在信号充分时有效—— 只是当前真实数据的信号不足。这完美支撑 pivot (1)：G-MFRM 是一个 \\\"备战\\\"框架——当前安全但已验证可在威胁升级时启动。 结合 pivot (3) \\\"Controlled Contamination Injection\\\"，adversarial experiment 可作为受控验证的自然延伸。\\n\\n在人工注入强污染（c_n ≈ 1.0, 5 个模型 fine-tuned on benchmark）后， G-MFRM 重新获得显著优势：τ=0.871 vs sequential 的 0.831（p=0.008）， RMSE reduction ~32%——接近 mvp_003 的合成结果。c_n recovery correlation 达到 0.82（因为注入的污染足够强，c_n 后验能从先验中拉出）。 收敛也改善（R̂=1.03, ESS=195）——数据中有足够信息驱动 c_n 估计。 这证明 G-MFRM 的检测和校正机制在信号充分时确实有效——问题不是方法 不工作，而是当前真实数据中信号不够强。adversarial experiment 同时 验证了 exp-009 的理论预测：当 c_mean 提升到 ~1.0 时，confounding 变得显著，G-MFRM 的联合估计优势重新显现。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":869,"startLine":1,"totalLines":869}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JRvMYomcgdYBHz8BePBJwm","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — gated_mfrm_judge_bias\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: AAAI 2027 (full paper, deadline July 28, 2026)\n5\t- Backup: ACL 2027 via ARR (submission August 3, 2026)\n6\t- Timeline: ~68 days from today (2026-05-21)\n7\t\n8\t## Core Insight\n9\tSequential approaches to judge bias correction and contamination adjustment produce biased model ability estimates due to omitted variable confounding. Joint estimation within a single psychometric calibration framework is methodologically necessary, not merely convenient.\n10\t\n11\t## Core Claims (3 条，均可证伪)\n12\t\n13\t1. **Confounding Claim**: When judge severity (d_j) and contamination susceptibility (c_n·e_i) are both present but only one is modeled, the unmodeled facet's effect is absorbed into other parameter estimates, producing systematic bias in model ability rankings. Sequential pipelines (bias-first or contamination-first) do not resolve this confounding.\n14\t\n15\t2. **Framework Claim**: The Gated Many-Facet Rasch Model (G-MFRM) — combining MFRM's multi-facet structure with DG-IRT's gating mechanism and externally-anchored exposure indicators — jointly estimates model ability, item difficulty, judge severity, and contamination susceptibility in a single calibration, yielding bias-and-contamination-corrected \"fair scores.\"\n16\t\n17\t3. **Empirical Claim**: G-MFRM fair scores achieve higher agreement with human rankings (Chatbot Arena votes, Kendall-τ) than all baselines: raw multi-judge averages, bias-only correction (CyclicJudge, UDA), contamination-only adjustment (DCR), and naive sequential pipelines.\n18\t\n19\t## Story Spine\n20\t\n21\t- **Problem**: LLM-as-a-judge evaluation has bifurcated into two correction silos — judge bias and benchmark contamination — that are addressed independently. But judge severity and contamination effects are confounded: bias-only methods absorb contamination inflation into ability estimates; contamination-only methods misattribute judge effects as contamination signals. Sequential correction cannot resolve this because the first stage's estimates are already biased by the unmodeled facet.\n22\t\n23\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: CyclicJudge eliminates average judge bias via round-robin but ignores contamination. UDA uses neural K-factor adjustment (−63.4% inter-judge std) but is black-box and contamination-unaware. DCR/ConStat quantify contamination effects (r²=0.94) but ignore judge variation. No existing work (0/12 surveyed papers, through May 2026) jointly models both within a single calibration framework.\n24\t\n25\t- **Our framing**: Joint estimation is methodologically necessary. We formalize this as an omitted variable bias problem: under non-orthogonality of d_j and c_n·e_i, sequential estimators are asymptotically biased (direction determined by covariance sign). G-MFRM resolves this by estimating all facets simultaneously, with a three-stage procedure ensuring identifiability: (1) standard MFRM for initial estimates, (2) external exposure anchoring via ConStat + temporal signals, (3) joint gated model with c_n as latent parameters.\n26\t\n27\t- **Headline result template**: \"On MT-Bench/Arena-Hard with 8 LLM judges, G-MFRM fair scores achieve X% higher Kendall-τ with Chatbot Arena human votes than the best sequential baseline, while simultaneously producing interpretable per-model contamination estimates and per-judge severity profiles.\"\n28\t\n29\t## Narrative Strategy (from distilled writing)\n30\t\n31\t- **Type**: \"突破局限\" (sequential has structural flaw) + \"统一框架\" (G-MFRM unifies both corrections)\n32\t- **Opening hook**: Quantitative shock — lead with confounding's θ-RMSE degradation (43.8% in synthetic, to be validated on real data)\n33\t- **Section 2**: Toy example / formal proposition demonstrating confounding before introducing G-MFRM method\n34\t- **Figure 1**: Left = sequential pipeline with confounding annotation, Right = joint G-MFRM with gating mechanism highlighted\n35\t- **Main result table**: rows = methods (7 baselines + G-MFRM), cols = benchmarks × metrics\n36\t- **Ablation**: Full numbers (not checkmark grid), rows = components on/off\n37\t\n38\t## Venue Fit Risks\n39\t\n40\t- **AAAI**: Good fit for psychometric methodology applied to AI evaluation. Risk: reviewers may lack MFRM/IRT background — need clear, self-contained exposition with toy examples. Strength: AAAI values formal modeling + practical impact.\n41\t- **ACL/ARR**: Good fit for LLM evaluation methodology. Risk: may demand stronger NLP-specific contributions beyond the measurement framework. Strength: directly relevant to LLM evaluation community.\n42\t\n43\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n44\t\n45\t1. **\"Why not CyclicJudge + discard contaminated items?\"** — Item discard wastes information; CyclicJudge doesn't capture item-specific judge effects; neither produces c_n for auditing; G-MFRM degrades gracefully to standard MFRM when contamination ≈ 0.\n46\t\n47\t2. **\"Is confounding large enough in practice?\"** — MVP synthetic: 43.8% RMSE degradation. Real-data calibration (P0 experiment) will establish realistic contamination magnitude. Bias scatter (r=0.65) shows the mechanism exists regardless of magnitude.\n48\t\n49\t3. **\"Rank-1 assumption (c_n·e_i) too strong\"** — Rank-1 is LLTM tradition, good approximation when contamination comes from dominant data source. Person-fit diagnostics (infit/outfit) detect violations. Rank-k extension is future work.\n50\t\n51\t4. **\"DG-IRT transfer is trivial\"** — Three structural differences require non-trivial adaptation: binary→continuous exposure, single-rater→multi-facet, known→unknown exposure status. Stage 2 external anchoring solves a fundamental obstacle (exposure unknown to administrator) absent in educational testing.\n52\t\n53\t5. **\"Contamination signal realistic?\"** — ConStat validated r²=0.94 with true contamination effects. LogProber provides per-item memorization indicators. Multiple indicators combined via weighted composite. P0 experiment calibrates against real benchmarks.\n54\t\n55\t## MVP Evidence Summary\n56\t\n57\t- mvp_003: Joint RMSE −43.8% vs Sequential (p=1e-6), Kendall-τ +6.3pp, R̂=1.03, ESS=224\n58\t- Bias scatter: Pearson r=0.65 (sequential systematically overestimates high-c_n models)\n59\t- Robustness: method effective even under model misspecification (DGP with s_j, model without)\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f762910b-0e14-4be4-bd77-f63c53231d74","uuid":"82f65972-d158-425a-af1d-804430681bb5","timestamp":"2026-05-21T21:11:20.349Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T204917/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — gated_mfrm_judge_bias\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: AAAI 2027 (full paper, deadline July 28, 2026)\n- Backup: ACL 2027 via ARR (submission August 3, 2026)\n- Timeline: ~68 days from today (2026-05-21)\n\n## Core Insight\nSequential approaches to judge bias correction and contamination adjustment produce biased model ability estimates due to omitted variable confounding. Joint estimation within a single psychometric calibration framework is methodologically necessary, not merely convenient.\n\n## Core Claims (3 条，均可证伪)\n\n1. **Confounding Claim**: When judge severity (d_j) and contamination susceptibility (c_n·e_i) are both present but only one is modeled, the unmodeled facet's effect is absorbed into other parameter estimates, producing systematic bias in model ability rankings. Sequential pipelines (bias-first or contamination-first) do not resolve this confounding.\n\n2. **Framework Claim**: The Gated Many-Facet Rasch Model (G-MFRM) — combining MFRM's multi-facet structure with DG-IRT's gating mechanism and externally-anchored exposure indicators — jointly estimates model ability, item difficulty, judge severity, and contamination susceptibility in a single calibration, yielding bias-and-contamination-corrected \"fair scores.\"\n\n3. **Empirical Claim**: G-MFRM fair scores achieve higher agreement with human rankings (Chatbot Arena votes, Kendall-τ) than all baselines: raw multi-judge averages, bias-only correction (CyclicJudge, UDA), contamination-only adjustment (DCR), and naive sequential pipelines.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: LLM-as-a-judge evaluation has bifurcated into two correction silos — judge bias and benchmark contamination — that are addressed independently. But judge severity and contamination effects are confounded: bias-only methods absorb contamination inflation into ability estimates; contamination-only methods misattribute judge effects as contamination signals. Sequential correction cannot resolve this because the first stage's estimates are already biased by the unmodeled facet.\n\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: CyclicJudge eliminates average judge bias via round-robin but ignores contamination. UDA uses neural K-factor adjustment (−63.4% inter-judge std) but is black-box and contamination-unaware. DCR/ConStat quantify contamination effects (r²=0.94) but ignore judge variation. No existing work (0/12 surveyed papers, through May 2026) jointly models both within a single calibration framework.\n\n- **Our framing**: Joint estimation is methodologically necessary. We formalize this as an omitted variable bias problem: under non-orthogonality of d_j and c_n·e_i, sequential estimators are asymptotically biased (direction determined by covariance sign). G-MFRM resolves this by estimating all facets simultaneously, with a three-stage procedure ensuring identifiability: (1) standard MFRM for initial estimates, (2) external exposure anchoring via ConStat + temporal signals, (3) joint gated model with c_n as latent parameters.\n\n- **Headline result template**: \"On MT-Bench/Arena-Hard with 8 LLM judges, G-MFRM fair scores achieve X% higher Kendall-τ with Chatbot Arena human votes than the best sequential baseline, while simultaneously producing interpretable per-model contamination estimates and per-judge severity profiles.\"\n\n## Narrative Strategy (from distilled writing)\n\n- **Type**: \"突破局限\" (sequential has structural flaw) + \"统一框架\" (G-MFRM unifies both corrections)\n- **Opening hook**: Quantitative shock — lead with confounding's θ-RMSE degradation (43.8% in synthetic, to be validated on real data)\n- **Section 2**: Toy example / formal proposition demonstrating confounding before introducing G-MFRM method\n- **Figure 1**: Left = sequential pipeline with confounding annotation, Right = joint G-MFRM with gating mechanism highlighted\n- **Main result table**: rows = methods (7 baselines + G-MFRM), cols = benchmarks × metrics\n- **Ablation**: Full numbers (not checkmark grid), rows = components on/off\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n\n- **AAAI**: Good fit for psychometric methodology applied to AI evaluation. Risk: reviewers may lack MFRM/IRT background — need clear, self-contained exposition with toy examples. Strength: AAAI values formal modeling + practical impact.\n- **ACL/ARR**: Good fit for LLM evaluation methodology. Risk: may demand stronger NLP-specific contributions beyond the measurement framework. Strength: directly relevant to LLM evaluation community.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n\n1. **\"Why not CyclicJudge + discard contaminated items?\"** — Item discard wastes information; CyclicJudge doesn't capture item-specific judge effects; neither produces c_n for auditing; G-MFRM degrades gracefully to standard MFRM when contamination ≈ 0.\n\n2. **\"Is confounding large enough in practice?\"** — MVP synthetic: 43.8% RMSE degradation. Real-data calibration (P0 experiment) will establish realistic contamination magnitude. Bias scatter (r=0.65) shows the mechanism exists regardless of magnitude.\n\n3. **\"Rank-1 assumption (c_n·e_i) too strong\"** — Rank-1 is LLTM tradition, good approximation when contamination comes from dominant data source. Person-fit diagnostics (infit/outfit) detect violations. Rank-k extension is future work.\n\n4. **\"DG-IRT transfer is trivial\"** — Three structural differences require non-trivial adaptation: binary→continuous exposure, single-rater→multi-facet, known→unknown exposure status. Stage 2 external anchoring solves a fundamental obstacle (exposure unknown to administrator) absent in educational testing.\n\n5. **\"Contamination signal realistic?\"** — ConStat validated r²=0.94 with true contamination effects. LogProber provides per-item memorization indicators. Multiple indicators combined via weighted composite. P0 experiment calibrates against real benchmarks.\n\n## MVP Evidence Summary\n\n- mvp_003: Joint RMSE −43.8% vs Sequential (p=1e-6), Kendall-τ +6.3pp, R̂=1.03, ESS=224\n- Bias scatter: Pearson r=0.65 (sequential systematically overestimates high-c_n models)\n- Robustness: method effective even under model misspecification (DGP with s_j, model without)\n","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":60}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_012LMLw4xufgUPsmtQHAxmvA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a thorough understanding of the experiment data and paper framing. Let me synthesize what I need to write:\n\nThe narrative guidance says the core confounding claim doesn't hold on real data — contamination is too weak. The paper needs to be reframed as a \"Diagnostic Framework\" — G-MFRM as a joint diagnostic tool that:\n1. Validates detection power on synthetic data\n2. Provides empirical evidence that \"current contamination has been mitigated\" on real data\n3. Provides ready-made tools for future monitoring\n\nKey experiments and their findings:\n1. **multi_judge_data_collection** — 8 judges × 22 models, ~186K evaluations, κ=0.38\n\n\n2. **constat_exposure_estimation** — exposure signals are barely detectable, with mean delta around 0.08 and only 12% of effects reaching significance\n3. **gmfrm_real_data_fit** — the contamination posterior centers near 0.14 with 78% credible intervals covering zero, suggesting the prior is doing most of the work\n4. **baseline_comparison** — G-MFRM shows marginal improvement over MFRM alone (0.851 vs 0.843) but the difference isn't statistically significant\n5. **contamination_magnitude_calibration** — real contamination estimates are an order of magnitude smaller than what we see in synthetic scenarios, which affects how much performance degradation we'd expect\n\nThe judge count sensitivity analysis shows G-MFRM doesn't outperform sequential approaches regardless of sample size, and individual exposure indicators contribute minimally to the overall ranking metric. The facet-level diagnostics reveal that while judge effects fit extremely well, contamination effects are poorly captured with substantial misfit. The theoretical framework holds up—confounding bias stays negligible when contamination stays below 0.4—and this pattern replicates across WildBench with strong judge correlations but weak contamination correlations. Interestingly, G-MFRM does show genuine robustness gains when contamination is artificially injected at higher levels, suggesting the model's benefits emerge under more adversarial conditions.\n\nI'm now reframing the paper around G-MFRM as a diagnostic and monitoring tool rather than claiming it solves a real contamination problem. The synthetic validation demonstrates the framework detects contamination when it's present, real data suggests current contamination is already well-mitigated, and the adversarial injection proves the system activates when needed. The formal theoretical proposition stands independently of the empirical magnitude. I need to write the full LaTeX paper for EMNLP 2026, positioning this as a worst-case scenario where the contamination hypothesis doesn't hold on actual data.\n\nWriting the paper now...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16045,"cache_read_input_tokens":23904,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16045},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f762910b-0e14-4be4-bd77-f63c53231d74","uuid":"fdef8634-1877-43dc-be69-a4f7a9a1a132"}
